================================================================================
DERIVED WORK — DeepSeek Harness
================================================================================

This product is a friendly adaptation of, and includes substantial portions
derived from, the DeepSeek Harness (DSH) open-source project:

    DeepSeek Harness
    https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness
    npm package: @deepseek-ai/dsh (currently pinned at 0.1.5-rc.2)
    Copyright DeepSeek AI and contributors
    Licensed under the terms published by the upstream project.

Clutch is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by DeepSeek AI.
The relationship between Clutch and DSH is one of in-repo derivation: code
in this repository reads, extends, and configures the upstream
@deepseek-ai/dsh binary as a pinned dependency, and a subset of files in
this repository were ported from prior BotFleet and Fleet-OPS work that
itself wrapped DSH.  No source from the upstream repository is vendored
into this one; the upstream binary is loaded at runtime via npm.

Specific derivations (each noted with the path in this repository):

- src/dsh/acp/driver.ts
    The DSH-specific ACP driver support shape — model catalog, version
    gate, error classification, credential candidates, model-id round-trip,
    env contract, install instructions, prompt composition.  Ported from
    BotFleet server/drivers/acp/dsh.ts on 2026-09-19.

- src/dsh/acp/mcp-patch.ts
    The `dsh --patch` overlay generator that delivers BotFleet's MCP
    mounts as `dsh-mcp-client` rows.  Ported from BotFleet
    server/drivers/acp/dsh-mcp.ts on 2026-09-19.

- bridges/dsh/dsh-acp.py
    The stdio JSON-RPC bridge that drives `dsh --profile deepseek-headless`
    for Shellular and other agent callers.  Carries production fixes
    (DEVNULL stdin, process-group kill, heartbeats) earned through real
    failures documented in
    ai-fleet-coordinator/docs/rollouts/2026-08-23-shellular-deepseek-thinking-fix.md
    and follow-ups.  Sourced from the prior
    ~/apps/dsh-runtime/dsh-acp.py install (tracked under
    ai-fleet-coordinator/scripts/dsh-runtime/dsh-acp.py).

- src/profiles/deepseek-headless/
    Tracked defaults for the deepseek-headless cordis profile.  Pattern
    ported from the prior ~/.dsh/profiles/headless/ install; the profile
    was renamed (headless -> dsh-headless) on 2026-09-19 to fix a boot
    manifest regression caused by patch cascade leakage into the web
    profile (see docs/migrate-from-dsh-runtime.md), and again to
    deepseek-headless on 2026-09-30 to match its Shellular agent id.

- src/web/start-web.ts, serve-tailscale.ts, ensure-web.ts, open-clutch.ts,
  install-dock-app.ts
    The web UI scripts that pm2 runs as `clutch-web` on :3180.  Ported
    from the prior ~/apps/dsh-runtime/start-web.sh and related shell
    scripts.

