INDEPENDENT COMPONENT — Clutch MiniMax Bridge
================================================================================

The minimax/ half of this repository (bridges/minimax/minimax-acp.py and
src/profiles/minimax-*/) is original work by the Clutch author.  MiniMax
itself ships an HTTP chat-completions API and rate-limit / balance
endpoints at https://platform.minimax.io — Clutch talks that API directly
because MiniMax does not (yet) publish an open-source CLI, sandbox, or
plugin system.  No code from any third-party MiniMax project is included.

    MiniMax API
    https://platform.minimax.io
    (Not affiliated; the relationship is consumer-only.)

================================================================================
INDEPENDENT COMPONENT — Clutch Muse Code Plugin
================================================================================

The Muse Code engine plugin (engines/muse-code.engine.json and
scripts/muse-code-acp.sh) is original work by the Clutch author.  It depends
on a third-party, unofficial community adapter:

    @bex-co/muse-code-acp
    npm package, Apache License 2.0
    Copyright its own authors; licensed under the terms published by
    that project.
    (Unofficial and community-maintained.  Meta does not endorse,
    sponsor, or support it.)

Muse Code is not itself an ACP agent: `muse serve` speaks MSP (Muse Session
Protocol), and the adapter above translates MSP to ACP on stdio.  No code from
the adapter is vendored into this repository; it is installed with
`npm install -g @bex-co/muse-code-acp` and exec'd at runtime.

    Muse Code / Muse Spark
    https://dev.meta.ai/docs/muse-code/
    Meta products.  Clutch is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported
    by Meta.

